#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Upgrade SPS recipe trees to the newest upstream stable release.

Maintainers run one command against core and extra. The tool detects the
current source, finds the newest non-prerelease upstream, rewrites
version/source/hash, resets release to 1, and scans the new tarball for
libraries the recipe does not yet declare. Names that already exist in the
trees are added as depend or builddep. Names that do not exist are reported,
and with --scaffold-missing a conservative extra recipe is drafted when a
source URL can be resolved.

Default is a dry-run plan. Pass --apply to write recipes.
"""
